{
  "dom_id": "step-e7938",
  "name": "Example: Identifying a Square Root Function Containing Two Translations",
  "problem": "The graph below is a translation of $y=\\sqrt{x}.$ Find the equation that generated the graph.    \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14238243/assets/d7705be833455f266e892f78ec29f0dee88a7e3e803a00f85dfdfd15ff5f6f92.png)",
  "worked_solution": "To obtain the given graph, we can perform the following transformations:\n\n- Take the graph of $y=\\sqrt{x}.$\n\n- Translate the graph to the  left by $2$ units to get the graph of $y=\\sqrt{x+2}.$\n\n- Translate the result  down by $1$ unit to get the graph of $y=\\sqrt{x+2}-1.$\n\nThe result is the solid blue curve shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14238243/assets/9af181a909b6ed88cee9ab8d331a09378ed75cc85a33d0f156a5b89ac91796cf.png)\n\nTherefore, the answer is $y=\\sqrt{x+2}-1.$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e7938\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Identifying a Square Root Function Containing Two Translations</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e7938\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n  